      <title>Three-Way Summit: Trump, Putin and Xi’s New World Order Has Arrived</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-19/three-way-summit-trump-putin-and-xi-s-new-world-order-has-arrived</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">23a3ae645a1c8b7b7c60cedb</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:37:51 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>There is a sense of inevitability to the images emerging from Shenzhen, where leaders of the world’s three largest military powers gathered around a table on Thursday, with China’s Xi Jinping at the center. This summit was bound to happen and, for all its lack of substance, marks something momentous: the passing of the old, liberal world order and Europe’s final humiliation.</description>
